# coherent.uland -- the forward-ported userland: everything the userland
# repository's host build produces, networking and MGR and the rest included.
#
# A USERLAND descriptor answers one question: where the user-visible files of a
# system come from.  The kernel and the loader are the other half and stay in
# systems/*.sys, so a dist may pair either kernel with either userland.
#
# The name says what an owner installs, not which release it is -- the release
# is the file the system descriptor's `version' key names, resolved at build
# time.  See ../FORMAT.
#
# Paths are relative to os/, exactly as in a .sys.
name	coherent
drv	hostbuild/build/drv
bin	hostbuild/build/bin
root	hostbuild/build/root
